    "text": "A chest released on 1 March 2024 with seven promos: Sprigatito ex SVP 087 and Pikachu SVP 088, not yet out in Japan; cosmos holofoil copies of Paldea Evolved's Pawmi, Pawmo and Tandemaus, found in no booster pack; and straight reprints of Pawmot ex and Maushold ex. It also held a deck box, a squishy Pikachu toy, stickers, a mini portfolio, six booster packs and a code card for Pokémon TCG Live.",
